  "reason": "The current best configuration (config_027: scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, transformer, weighted, acc=0.725) has been established through a series of experiments that confirmed multiprofile >> singleprofile, scvi_n200 >> scgpt, and multimodal > rna_only. However, the image encoder choice has never been varied—all multimodal experiments used imagenet_vit_l. config_033 (scvi_n200, resnet50, transformer, weighted) isolates the effect of the image encoder while holding all other design choices at their best-known settings. This is the highest-uncertainty remaining design decision: if resnet50 performs comparably, the image encoder is not a critical lever and we can focus budget on other dimensions; if it degrades performance, it confirms the ViT's importance and justifies the added complexity. This single-variable comparison to the current best is the most efficient use of the next experiment under a limited budget."
}

